# Mobile Expansion & System Cleanup Plan

This plan addresses the broken images in the SmartCart Optimizer, completes the Admin Dashboard routing, resolves persistent lint warnings in CSS, and verifies the Capacitor-based mobile expansion.

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Product Data & Images
#### [MODIFY] [productData.ts](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/data/productData.ts)
- Replace broken Unsplash image URLs for Cheddar Cheese, Baguette, Penne Rigate, and Black Beans.

#### [MODIFY] [StoreDetail.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/consumer/StoreDetail.tsx)
- Ensure all product images across the 11 stores are using valid, non-broken Unsplash URLs.
- Sync any changes made to products here with [productData.ts](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/data/productData.ts) if applicable.

### 2. Admin Dashboard Layout & Routing
#### [MODIFY] [App.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/App.tsx)
- Map `/admin/audit-logs` to `AdminAuditLogs` component.
- Map `/admin/flyers` to `AdminFlyerModeration` component.
- Ensure all admin routes are correctly nested within the `AdminLayout`.

#### [MODIFY] [Dashboard.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/admin/Dashboard.tsx)
- Update the dashboard component if needed to ensure better navigation or visibility of new modules.

### 3. Cleanup & Linting
#### [MODIFY] [design-system.css](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/styles/design-system.css)
- Investigate and resolve the "Unknown at rule @tailwind" warning by ensuring standard Tailwind directives or adding lint suppression if necessary.

### 4. Mobile Expansion (Capacitor)
- Verify `VITE_FIREBASE_*` environment variables are correctly loaded in native builds.
- Run `npx cap sync` to ensure all web assets are updated in the `android` and `ios` folders.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npm run build` in `apps/web` to ensure no TypeScript or build errors.

### Manual Verification
1. **Broken Images**: Navigate to `/smartcart` and verify all product icons load correctly.
2. **Admin Dashboard**: Navigate to `/admin/dashboard`, `/admin/users`, `/admin/audit-logs`, and `/admin/flyers` to verify routing and content.
3. **Safe Area**: Use browser developer tools to simulate mobile devices (e.g., iPhone 12 Pro) and verify the header/footer padding.
4. **Capacitor Sync**: Check `apps/web/android/app/src/main/assets/public/` to ensure the latest build files are present.
